{"data": [{"author_id": "2400149185", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:29:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125008782036189560"], "id": "2125008782036189560", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124998553856844186", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux I can’t tell my chat session to talk to my dot by tagging it.  Makes it hard to keep it up to date.", "url": "https://x.com/SplittMedia/status/2125008782036189560"}, {"author_id": "1846568246381584384", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:22:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125006983292228065"], "id": "2125006983292228065", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "That's just typical me.\n\nThe day I finally decide to upgrade my X subscription to get Grok Bot OpenAI introduces travel mode and my dot pops up in Codex(EU)\n\nWell two is better then none.\n\nHave a good night everybody and keep shipping!", "url": "https://x.com/BobClowdr/status/2125006983292228065"}, {"author_id": "1594785140823232536", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:21:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125006802324467727"], "id": "2125006802324467727", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3424693618", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2125001011269980500", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Polarislnfinite @thsottiaux The absolute nonsense babysitting that they throw into the models these days is INSANE.\n\nIm a trained electrical engineer and STILL had gpt-live voice giving me the \"let a LICENSED electrician do it\" garbage.  Even after CORRECTING and accepted, MY DOT HAD THE NERVE TO SEND ME", "url": "https://x.com/XProfessah/status/2125006802324467727"}, {"author_id": "1335599733033852928", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:16:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125005591181697360"], "id": "2125005591181697360", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124923055072043052", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Dots are literally useless. I can't get ANYTHING done with them ever\n\nNot once have I thought \"oh I'll just get my dot to do that\" \n\nNot once. https://t.co/t8GebkG2sV", "url": "https://x.com/hatsunama/status/2125005591181697360"}, {"author_id": "2083659123321647104", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:14:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125005169217978673"], "id": "2125005169217978673", "in_reply_to_user_id": "384098551", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124862750643896648", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@_samirism Great to hear, not getting transcripts from the calls almost caused me to not use my dot at all for the first month and I really only did because it was being pushed at such a discount - but the cost of not capturing that context is unknown.\n\nHow far back can we get transcripts?", "url": "https://x.com/Caffoclaw/status/2125005169217978673"}, {"author_id": "205871725", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:14:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125005110480630191"], "id": "2125005110480630191", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124972402748604445", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus I've just started using it. I'm really starting to enjoy Grokbot, but my dot is so much smarter. The moment I can have multiple dots I'm canceling grokbot.", "url": "https://x.com/victorrseloy/status/2125005110480630191"}, {"author_id": "1723732993875775488", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:11:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125004267367112776"], "id": "2125004267367112776", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124923055072043052", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux When I arrive at the office, my Dot usually has reviews of new PRs and Issues in my repositories prepared for me with summary, test results and conclusions. Those conclusions are usually dead wrong. Occasionally it says, it can’t help me with that, after not being asked anything.", "url": "https://x.com/fi9rn27jg389m43/status/2125004267367112776"}, {"author_id": "2083659123321647104", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:10:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125004159342559588"], "id": "2125004159342559588", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2083659123321647104", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124923867785314735", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux I finally gave up and had Claude put the page up. Esma, my Dot, was simply not up to the task. I'm still finding stuff she left out of the handoff, like the audio for the opener of the embedded video. \n\nHere's Captain Esma and the doomed ship Dot-tober.\n\nhttps://t.co/32xHEbmT4Z", "url": "https://x.com/Caffoclaw/status/2125004159342559588"}, {"author_id": "2028443345077641216", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:01:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125001890866020667"], "id": "2125001890866020667", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My dot (stella💫) created a card game using my text messages &lt;3 let me know if you fall in love after playing….. just between us😉\n\nhttps://t.co/MVL1nvJLPA", "url": "https://x.com/gheedbizri21/status/2125001890866020667"}, {"author_id": "1816451042705346561", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:01:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125001876408094732"], "id": "2125001876408094732", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124998553856844186", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux Absolutely loving the new app layout! Jumping between Chat, Hopper (my Dot), and Codex is so much easier now. That alone eliminated a big pain point in my daily workflow.\n\nSol 6.2 in Chat is already a noticeable improvement too.\n\nReally liking the direction you guys are taking", "url": "https://x.com/ZerriusVale/status/2125001876408094732"}, {"author_id": "1410652450781118470", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:59:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125001420076466319"], "id": "2125001420076466319", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1714438092655149056", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ChatGPT I attempted to change the color of my Dot, and now my Dot is paused and it errors out on both iOS and Mac. What's going on?", "url": "https://x.com/jaseduke/status/2125001420076466319"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2124996107730034689", "3_2124996107734298624"]}, "author_id": "1832955903051784193", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:56:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124996112016957574", "2125000458414797067"], "id": "2125000458414797067", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My dot is finally in the UK https://t.co/0KblW8SUCn", "url": "https://x.com/RonakShah94/status/2125000458414797067"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2124999374711431168"]}, "author_id": "1426843093", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:51:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124999377270038662"], "id": "2124999377270038662", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "change my mind: \n\nchatgpt dots is still useless, billions in funding and thousands of GPUs just to ship colorful blobs. https://t.co/BiDWkG9XwQ", "url": "https://x.com/anh_duck/status/2124999377270038662"}, {"author_id": "83731546", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:50:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124999002491957589"], "id": "2124999002491957589", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3248582164", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124918402770935846", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@wattTheHell6 My Dot asks my permission to click 'Im not a robot '. It is a strange time we love ve in", "url": "https://x.com/webcheatsheet/status/2124999002491957589"}, {"author_id": "1510455703890190348", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:42:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124997022423908544"], "id": "2124997022423908544", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124923055072043052", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux The only way my dot can do anything for me is by having the desktop apo open on my pc with a ton of relevant tabs open in my browser, and leaving everything open there all day and night.\n\nAnd they're not \"always on\". I need to setup a ton of scheduled task for it to stay alert.", "url": "https://x.com/TLetalnet/status/2124997022423908544"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2124995454962167808"]}, "author_id": "4464404475", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:37:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124995803039359085"], "id": "2124995803039359085", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🇪🇺 OpenAI Dots are finally arriving in Europe!\n\nAfter a long wait, Dots are now reportedly rolling out across the EU and UK.\n\nAnd this could be one of the most interesting steps toward truly personal AI agents.\n\nInstead of constantly asking ChatGPT what to do next, imagine having https://t.co/20GELg8wF4", "url": "https://x.com/PetrosBitcoin/status/2124995803039359085"}, {"author_id": "2095993819464400897", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:28:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124993597548159137"], "id": "2124993597548159137", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1499460382158725120", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 107, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124974118491849062", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@TokenGremlin MY DOT HAS APPEARED", "url": "https://x.com/aimedialabs/status/2124993597548159137"}, {"author_id": "128497494", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:23:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124992336459706378"], "id": "2124992336459706378", "in_reply_to_user_id": "384098551", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 281, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124977997493248084", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@_samirism @kimmonismus Please keep the new ChatGPT design enabled in Travel Mode as well. Right now, my dot still works in the EU, but the app switches back to the old layout.", "url": "https://x.com/mdvolk/status/2124992336459706378"}, {"author_id": "196073025", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:15:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124990154754408947"], "id": "2124990154754408947", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 131, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "— Waiting for OpenAI Dots in the EU for ChatGPT Plus users.", "url": "https://x.com/oncescuradu/status/2124990154754408947"}, {"author_id": "8721292", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:14:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124989981470908559"], "id": "2124989981470908559", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 6021, "like_count": 79, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 9}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124969484364697800", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Update about OpenAI Dots in Europe:\n\nOfficially, Dots is still not available in Europe. However, OpenAI added a \"travel mode\" for Americans being abroad, so that they can continue using Dots.\n\nWhat this means is, you need to use a US VPN once to create the Dots, but then it will https://t.co/v3nTbCsZAa", "url": "https://x.com/mark_k/status/2124989981470908559"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2124986704117571584"]}, "author_id": "33416756", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:04:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124987514192879850"], "id": "2124987514192879850", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I finally experienced the magic! 🪄\n\nMy dot became available today, and it took one Slack notification for me to get it.\n\nI built Hello You Gifts, a web app that lets people create personalized children’s books. I set it up to send errors to Slack so I get notified if a user ever https://t.co/aQJXVBsfPE", "url": "https://x.com/karalynnbyrne/status/2124987514192879850"}, {"author_id": "58985575", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:00:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124986470754824384"], "id": "2124986470754824384", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1725046617181753344", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impres